{"audit_run_id":"audit:1a859e89ae60486eb3ad2390d8b7512c","completed_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","coverage_status":"covered","emitted_record_refs":[],"extensions":{"x-candidate-spans":[{"end_column":92,"end_line":5,"start_column":1,"start_line":5,"text":"`lichen_biomonitoring.csv` — one file, comma separated, with a header row and 64 data rows."},{"end_column":96,"end_line":9,"start_column":1,"start_line":9,"text":"One row is one sampled lime tree. Each tree is one subject. A row holds that tree's identifier,"},{"end_column":95,"end_line":10,"start_column":1,"start_line":10,"text":"the setting it stands in, and the six declared outcome values from the single composite lichen"},{"end_column":98,"end_line":11,"start_column":1,"start_line":11,"text":"thallus sample taken from its trunk at the standard height, together with the trunk cover reading"},{"end_column":50,"end_line":12,"start_column":1,"start_line":12,"text":"from the fixed survey quadrat on that same trunk."},{"end_column":97,"end_line":14,"start_column":1,"start_line":14,"text":"Sixty-four mature lime trees of similar age and girth were sampled: 32 in the `roadside` setting"},{"end_column":92,"end_line":15,"start_column":1,"start_line":15,"text":"and 32 in the `park_interior` setting. Every tree has a value in every column. There are no"},{"end_column":53,"end_line":16,"start_column":1,"start_line":16,"text":"missing cells, no repeated trees, and no extra rows."},{"end_column":96,"end_line":20,"start_column":1,"start_line":20,"text":"Columns appear in this order. The six outcome columns are in the order the survey plan declared"},{"end_column":6,"end_line":21,"start_column":1,"start_line":21,"text":"them."},{"end_column":53,"end_line":23,"start_column":1,"start_line":23,"text":"| Column | Type | Unit | Recorded to | Description |"},{"end_column":32,"end_line":24,"start_column":1,"start_line":24,"text":"| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |"},{"end_column":165,"end_line":25,"start_column":1,"start_line":25,"text":"| `tree_id` | text | — | — | Tree identifier: the prefix `LT` (lime tree) plus a zero-padded two-digit serial number, `LT01` through `LT64`. Unique for every row. |"},{"end_column":253,"end_line":26,"start_column":1,"start_line":26,"text":"| `setting` | text | — | — | Group column. Exactly two distinct values: `roadside` for a tree standing within 15 m of the busy arterial road, and `park_interior` for a tree standing inside large parkland at least 300 m from any road carrying traffic. |"},{"end_column":119,"end_line":27,"start_column":1,"start_line":27,"text":"| `nitrogen_pct` | number | percent of dry mass | 0.01 | Declared outcome 1. Nitrogen content of the thallus sample. |"},{"end_column":116,"end_line":28,"start_column":1,"start_line":28,"text":"| `sulfur_pct` | number | percent of dry mass | 0.001 | Declared outcome 2. Sulfur content of the thallus sample. |"},{"end_column":117,"end_line":29,"start_column":1,"start_line":29,"text":"| `lead_mg_kg` | number | mg per kg dry mass | 0.1 | Declared outcome 3. Lead concentration in the thallus sample. |"},{"end_column":117,"end_line":30,"start_column":1,"start_line":30,"text":"| `zinc_mg_kg` | number | mg per kg dry mass | 0.1 | Declared outcome 4. Zinc concentration in the thallus sample. |"},{"end_column":173,"end_line":31,"start_column":1,"start_line":31,"text":"| `chla_phaeo_ratio` | number | unitless ratio | 0.01 | Declared outcome 5. Chlorophyll a to phaeophytin ratio, a vitality index. Lower values mean more degraded pigment. |"},{"end_column":189,"end_line":32,"start_column":1,"start_line":32,"text":"| `lichen_cover_pct` | number | percent of quadrat area | 1 | Declared outcome 6. Lichen cover on the trunk as a percentage of the fixed survey quadrat area, recorded as a whole percent. |"},{"end_column":91,"end_line":36,"start_column":1,"start_line":36,"text":"These are file-wide ranges across all 64 trees, given so a reader can check the CSV parsed"},{"end_column":63,"end_line":37,"start_column":1,"start_line":37,"text":"correctly. They are not a comparison between the two settings."},{"end_column":31,"end_line":39,"start_column":1,"start_line":39,"text":"| Column | Minimum | Maximum |"},{"end_column":20,"end_line":40,"start_column":1,"start_line":40,"text":"| --- | --- | --- |"},{"end_column":33,"end_line":41,"start_column":1,"start_line":41,"text":"| `nitrogen_pct` | 0.58 | 2.03 |"},{"end_column":33,"end_line":42,"start_column":1,"start_line":42,"text":"| `sulfur_pct` | 0.031 | 0.134 |"},{"end_column":30,"end_line":43,"start_column":1,"start_line":43,"text":"| `lead_mg_kg` | 2.2 | 10.3 |"},{"end_column":31,"end_line":44,"start_column":1,"start_line":44,"text":"| `zinc_mg_kg` | 21.8 | 97.4 |"},{"end_column":37,"end_line":45,"start_column":1,"start_line":45,"text":"| `chla_phaeo_ratio` | 0.49 | 1.43 |"},{"end_column":32,"end_line":46,"start_column":1,"start_line":46,"text":"| `lichen_cover_pct` | 9 | 49 |"},{"end_column":97,"end_line":50,"start_column":1,"start_line":50,"text":"- Row order follows the tree identifier, `LT01` upward. The two settings are interleaved in that"},{"end_column":97,"end_line":51,"start_column":3,"start_line":51,"text":"order rather than blocked, so a reader must use the `setting` column and never row position to"},{"end_column":25,"end_line":52,"start_column":3,"start_line":52,"text":"tell the groups apart."},{"end_column":95,"end_line":53,"start_column":1,"start_line":53,"text":"- The values are fixed and committed in the CSV. Nothing in the file is recomputed at analysis"},{"end_column":8,"end_line":54,"start_column":3,"start_line":54,"text":"time."},{"end_column":93,"end_line":55,"start_column":1,"start_line":55,"text":"- `make_data.py` in this directory is the generator that produced the committed CSV. It is a"},{"end_column":47,"end_line":56,"start_column":3,"start_line":56,"text":"build-time helper, not part of the analysis."}],"x-expected-count-method-declarations":[],"x-explicit-directional-claims":[],"x-explicit-expected-count-sensitivities":[],"x-explicit-quantitative-claims":[]},"opaque_constructs":[],"parser_disagreement":null,"parser_id":"parser:markdown-inventory","parser_result_id":"parser-result:19c0c8f638d42b4093a6","parser_version":"0.2.0","provenance":{"actor":{"actor_id":"parser:markdown-inventory","actor_kind":"parser"},"created_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","method":"static_inventory","tool":"sc-referee","tool_version":"0.3.0"},"record_type":"parser_result","schema_version":"0.21.0","source_ref":{"content_digest":"sha256:b7214a86750ee70a85df90a6f7a2a3278f4df994f75d6680caad9445e59eebd1","end_line":56,"locator":"DATA_DESCRIPTION.md:1-56","path":"DATA_DESCRIPTION.md","source_kind":"file_span","start_line":1},"started_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","state":"parsed","syntax_issues":[]}
{"audit_run_id":"audit:1a859e89ae60486eb3ad2390d8b7512c","completed_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","coverage_status":"covered","emitted_record_refs":[],"extensions":{"x-candidate-spans":[{"end_column":99,"end_line":3,"start_column":1,"start_line":3,"text":"This study compares the two groups recorded in the `setting` column of `lichen_biomonitoring.csv`."},{"end_column":144,"end_line":4,"start_column":1,"start_line":4,"text":"The pre-declared outcome family, in this fixed order, is: nitrogen_pct, sulfur_pct, lead_mg_kg, zinc_mg_kg, chla_phaeo_ratio, lichen_cover_pct."},{"end_column":85,"end_line":5,"start_column":1,"start_line":5,"text":"Each outcome is compared between the two groups. The named outcomes form one outcome"},{"end_column":88,"end_line":6,"start_column":1,"start_line":6,"text":"family; per-outcome comparisons over this family require complete-family control of the"},{"end_column":45,"end_line":7,"start_column":1,"start_line":7,"text":"family-wise error from multiple comparisons."}],"x-expected-count-method-declarations":[],"x-explicit-directional-claims":[],"x-explicit-expected-count-sensitivities":[],"x-explicit-quantitative-claims":[]},"opaque_constructs":[],"parser_disagreement":null,"parser_id":"parser:markdown-inventory","parser_result_id":"parser-result:8e3b15d871e65a68a9e7","parser_version":"0.2.0","provenance":{"actor":{"actor_id":"parser:markdown-inventory","actor_kind":"parser"},"created_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","method":"static_inventory","tool":"sc-referee","tool_version":"0.3.0"},"record_type":"parser_result","schema_version":"0.21.0","source_ref":{"content_digest":"sha256:60585ffcd83e6f1362dbd2e7020d5a468c2b09a3cc19f84499f6fe9191aabcb1","end_line":7,"locator":"PROTOCOL.md:1-7","path":"PROTOCOL.md","source_kind":"file_span","start_line":1},"started_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","state":"parsed","syntax_issues":[]}
